assisted with human editorial control; text and code are human–AI co-written. — 3Cats Studio, Amsterdam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:12:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694172","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036870-1846651706690161","game_id":"steam-5036870","kind":"announcement","title":"PLEASE CONFIRM THE DECEASED demo: recorded gameplay","summary":"A recorded run through the free demo plays here on some evenings (18:00–24:00 CET/CEST) during Steam Next Fest: cases examined, rulings made. It is not live, so a question in chat may wait a while. The demo is free on this page.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:12:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036870-1846651706686498","game_id":"steam-5036870","kind":"announcement","title":"The night shift is open: the first two nights are free","summary":"The intake desk is open The first two nights of PLEASE CONFIRM THE DECEASED are free on Steam, starting today, and the game is part of Steam Next Fest until 26 October. You are the night clerk at a municipal morgue. A bell rings. A file comes through the hatch. Behind the glass, a covered gurney rolls into the intake bay. Your job is written down: confirm that the paperwork and the body are the same thing. What the demo holds The first two nights of the shift: the hatch, the file, the gurney, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:16:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686498","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036870-1842212951311198","game_id":"steam-5036870","kind":"announcement","title":"Do not open the bag. Do not speak to it.","summary":"Hello — this is the first word from us on this page, so it may as well be the job description. You are the new night clerk at a municipal morgue in a city that produces more bodies than it can explain. A bell rings. Paperwork comes through the hatch. Behind the glass, a covered gurney rolls into the intake bay. Your job is simple and it is written down: confirm that the paperwork and the body are the same thing. Read the file — death certificate, transfer manifest, personal effects, a polaroid. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T18:52:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311198","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5036870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5036870":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5036870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z"},"5072960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:35:37Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5036870","app_id":5036870,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_succ